CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786025912
OL,3,CWalk-in mental health support centres
OL,4,Cto open in banks and libraries in
OL,5,CEngland
OL,7,FNew walk-in support centres will be
OL,8,Fopened across high streets in England
OL,9,Ffor people needing mental health
OL,10,Fsupport, the government has announced.
OL,12,FThe support centres will be in
OL,13,Flibraries, banks and other high street
OL,14,Flocations, as well as in new
OL,15,Ffacilities.
OL,17,FPeople will not need to be referred to
OL,18,Faccess help.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
