OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786025912
OL,3,CWalk-in mental health support centres
OL,4,Cto open in banks and libraries in
OL,5,CEngland
OL,7,FOfficials also announced that more
OL,8,Fpeople in a mental health crisis will
OL,9,Fbe given specialist care in dedicated
OL,10,Fmental health emergency departments,
OL,11,Frather than waiting in busy A&Es.
OL,13,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said that
OL,14,Fthe new centres will be a "lifeline"
OL,15,Ffor the thousands of people who are
OL,16,Fwaiting "months" for help.
OL,26,@vD@[OUvD@dO]xD@IOUxD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786025912
OL,3,CWalk-in mental health support centres
OL,4,Cto open in banks and libraries in
OL,5,CEngland
OL,7,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,8,FCare said that there will be 100 new
OL,9,Fcommunity mental health centres and 59
OL,10,Fdedicated mental health emergency
OL,11,Fdepartments in the "biggest redesign
OL,12,Fof mental health services in a
OL,13,Fgeneration".
OL,15,FMeanwhile, extra mental health
OL,16,Femergency departments will offer same-
OL,17,Fday support for people experiencing a
OL,18,Fcrisis who are medically fit and do
OL,19,Fnot need treatment in A&E.
OL,26,@sD@TOUuD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786025912
OL,3,CWalk-in mental health support centres
OL,4,Cto open in banks and libraries in
OL,5,CEngland
OL,7,FThese specialist facilities will be
OL,8,Flocated within emergency departments
OL,9,Fand will provide a "calm, therapeutic
OL,10,Fenvironment where people can be
OL,11,Fassessed quickly", officials said.
OL,13,FThe rollout will bring the number of
OL,14,Fdedicated mental health emergency
OL,15,Fdepartments in England to 82.
OL,26,@qD@TOUsD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
