OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786025912
OL,3,CWalk-in mental health support centres
OL,4,Cto open in banks and libraries in
OL,5,CEngland
OL,7,FBurnham said: "Nobody should be left
OL,8,Fto struggle with their mental health
OL,9,Falone. But every day, thousands of
OL,10,Fpeople are waiting months for help,
OL,11,Fthen finding the only door open to
OL,12,Fthem is a busy A&E.
OL,14,F"These new centres will be a lifeline
OL,15,Ffor so many. They will bring NHS
OL,16,Fservices closer to home, making it
OL,17,Feasier to get support before problems
OL,18,Fget worse, and ensuring those in
OL,19,Fcrisis get the right care in the right
OL,20,Fplace."
OL,26,@oD@OOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786025912
OL,3,CWalk-in mental health support centres
OL,4,Cto open in banks and libraries in
OL,5,CEngland
OL,7,FThe Department said that the
OL,8,Finitiative is backed by #343 million
OL,9,Fand the first sites will open in
OL,10,Fautumn this year, with "further
OL,11,Ffacilities following from March 2027".
OL,13,FHealth Secretary Yvette Cooper said:
OL,14,F"This is how we can turn the tide on
OL,15,Fmental ill health ` preventing more
OL,16,Fpeople from reaching crisis, cutting
OL,17,Fwaits for care, and building an NHS
OL,18,Fwhich is there for everyone when they
OL,19,Fneed it."
OL,26,@rD@XOUsD@eO]vD@AOU{D@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786025912
OL,3,CWalk-in mental health support centres
OL,4,Cto open in banks and libraries in
OL,5,CEngland
OL,7,FThe announcement forms part of the
OL,8,Fforthcoming Mental Health Strategy,
OL,9,Fwhich is expected to be published
OL,10,Flater this year.
OL,12,FThe strategy will be informed by the
OL,13,Findependent review into mental health
OL,14,Fconditions, ADHD and autism, which is
OL,15,Fexpected in the autumn.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786025912
OL,3,CWalk-in mental health support centres
OL,4,Cto open in banks and libraries in
OL,5,CEngland
OL,7,FAccording to NHS figures, 2.36 million
OL,8,Fpeople in England had an open referral
OL,9,Fwith mental health services at the end
OL,10,Fof May 2026, up from 2.10 million a
OL,11,Fyear earlier and 1.95 million in May
OL,12,F2024.
OL,14,FBrian Dow, deputy chief executive at
OL,15,Fthe charity Rethink Mental Illness,
OL,16,Fsaid: "The expansion of neighbourhood
OL,17,Fmental health centres is a vital step
OL,18,Ftowards making this a reality,
OL,19,Fbuilding on the promising results of
OL,20,Fexisting pilot sites.
OL,26,@xD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786025912
OL,3,CWalk-in mental health support centres
OL,4,Cto open in banks and libraries in
OL,5,CEngland
OL,7,F"By bringing together treatment and
OL,8,Fwider support services under one roof,
OL,9,Fthese centres can transform
OL,10,Fexperiences of care, helping people to
OL,11,Faccess support earlier and preventing
OL,12,Fthem from reaching crisis point."
OL,14,FTom Pollard from the charity Mind
OL,15,Fadded: "This is a promising step
OL,16,Ftowards more people getting the mental
OL,17,Fhealth support they need, when they
OL,18,Fneed it. Too often, we hear from
OL,19,Fpeople struggling to access
OL,20,Foverstretched services whose mental
OL,21,Fhealth worsens because of this."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@aO]wD@HOU}D@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
